Answer with the structured response, filling its top-level fields directly:
`reasoning` (why this portfolio), `workstreams` (one entry per new workstream), and
`hypothesis_updates` (parks and abandonments; empty when there are none). Do not wrap
the plan in another field or write it as JSON text inside a field.
